!
!>    \par Purpose:
!     =============
!>
!>    \verbatim
!>       
!>    MQC_ElementVectorProduct is a function that multiplies two MQC vectors 
!>    elementwise and stores them into another MQC vector.
!>
!>    \endverbatim
!
!     Arguments:
!     ==========
!>    \param[in] Vector1In
!>    \verbatim
!>        Vector1In is Type(MQC_Vector)
!>        The frist MQC vector to multiply elementwise.
!>    \endverbatim
!>
!>    \param[in] Vector2In
!>    \verbatim
