!>
!>    |v| <= Max(MQC_very_small,0.0) counts as zero (the threshold approach of
!>    mqc_integral_put): exactly zero when MQC_very_small is negative.
!>
!>    \endverbatim
!
!     Authors:
!     ========
!>    \author M. M. F. Moraes
!>    \date 2026
!
      Function MQC_Matrix_Zero_Thresh() Result(Thresh)
