!>        The MQC scalar to multiply.
!>    \endverbatim
!
!     Authors:
!     ========
!>    \author L. M. Thompson
!>    \date 2020
!
      Function MQC_R4TensorScalarProduct(Tensor,ScalarIn) Result(Tensor_Res)
!
      Implicit None
      class(*),intent(in)::scalarIn
